    "synopsis": {
        "native": "La Muette est une cit\u00e9 HLM de la r\u00e9gion parisienne. Pourtant derri\u00e8re ces murs se cache l\u2019ancien camp de Drancy o\u00f9 pr\u00e8s de 80 000 juifs furent intern\u00e9s avant d\u2019\u00eatre envoy\u00e9s pour la majorit\u00e9 d\u2019entre eux vers les camps de la mort. Les habitants d\u2019hier et d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui s\u2019y croisent comme si la trag\u00e9die \u00e9tait attach\u00e9e \u00e0 son sol et \u00e0 travers le temps ...",
        "english": "La Muette is public housing project on the outskirts of Paris. However, behind its walls hides Drancy, a former deportation camp, where nearly 80,000 Jews were confined before most were sent to the death camps. Inhabitants of the past and present cross paths as though the tragedy were connected to the area's ground and across time."
